[8.688672, "o", "--- ROUTE ---\r\n"]
[8.689981, "o", "Pipeline modules live with the CLI under /app/deskbin and as sibling sources under /app. Spool bytes sit in /app/dropwell. Fixture copies sit at /app/seed/dropwell. Side listing helper is /app/dropwalk.\r\n"]
[8.69014, "o", "--- FORMAT ---\r\n"]
[8.691058, "o", "CLAT dump (little-endian):\r\n\r\n  magic     4 bytes  \"CLAT\"\r\n  version   u16\r\n  write_stamp u32   dump-write unix seconds\r\n  nstreams  u16\r\n  then n directory entries: stype u32, rva u32, size u32\r\n\r\nStream type 3 (exception): dwLowDateTime u32, dwHighDateTime u32, code u32.\r\nThose two dwords are a Windows FILETIME (100-nanosecond ticks; 10000000 ticks per second).\r\nThe FILETIME epoch is 1601-01-01, 11644473600 seconds before Unix epoch.\r\n\r\nStream type 15 (misc): 16-byte guid, then companion u8 (0 = primary, 1 = extra).\r\n\r\nDigest on the keg is SHA-256 (sha256) of the dump file, written as lowercase hex.\r\n\r\nExtra dumps added under the well, including names such as mid.clat, use this same layout.\r\nFixture copies of the well live at /app/seed/dropwell.\r\n"]
[8.691507, "o", "--- TREE ---\r\n"]
[8.694289, "o", "/app/bin/clatter\r\n/app/deskbin/emit.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/main.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/parse.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/pipe.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/sum.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/usage.txt\r\n/app/dropwalk/mtime.rs\r\n/app/dropwell/a.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/a2.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/b.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/d.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/e.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/e2.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/old.clat\r\n/app/fat.sh\r\n/app/fold.rs\r\n/app/kegbay/MARK\r\n/app/kegbay/batch.tsv\r\n"]
